 in: 0px\;" data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">"Trust\, but Verify: Living
  with AI Agents"</span></strong></p><p data-pm-slice="1 1 []"><span data-
 olk-copy-source="MessageBody">Consumer AI agents promise better deals\, c
 leaner inboxes\, and relief from the steady enshittification of apps and 
