 em to agree: Amazon and\, more recently\, United Airlines have pushed bac
 k rather than cede any control of their platforms.</span></p><p data-pm-s
 lice="1 1 []"><span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">Beneath the promis
 e\, though\, lie hard questions of trust. How do we know our agents are f
 inding the best deals\, or that they understand what we want when we ofte
 n don't know ourselves? And how do we know they aren't manipulating us\, 
